  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-79781",
  "summary": "rclone serve s3 Path Traversal via dot-dot object keys",
  "details": "rclone serve s3 before 1.74.4 contains a path traversal vulnerability that allows attackers to read and overwrite root-level files by using dot-dot segments in S3 object keys. Attackers can send requests with object keys like ../root-secret.txt to escape the bucket namespace and access files in the serve root directory.",
